          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:apply_object",
            object: "%7B%22id%22%3A%22ruby_of_fire%22%2C%22effects%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22abilities%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
            id: "Prince Haldric",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_16",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("Several months pass. Jessene has translated Lich-Lord Caror’s Book of Fire and Darkness. Prince Haldric is busy probing the secrets of the Ruby of Fire."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Prince Haldric",
            portrait: "portraits/haldric-annoyed.webp",
            text: _("I think I’ve figured something out. Look."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Prince Haldric",
            portrait: "portraits/haldric-mad.webp",
            text: _("Ouch! Hot, hot, hot! Gee, somebody should really attach this thing to a scepter or something! I think I’ll save it for closer-ranged combat for now."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Lady Jessene",
            text: _("Watch it! Well, at least you’re improving."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Burin the Lost",
            portrait: "portraits/burin-annoyed.webp",
            text: _("Humph. Fool of a boy’s just gonna burn us all up. Humans, always playing at being wizards."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Southbay Guard 1",
            text: _("Orcs sighted! They’ve seized the frontier! To arms! To arms!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Sir Ladoc",
            text: _("For the glory of Southbay!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "King Addroran IX",
            text: _("Prince Haldric, I’ll concentrate on holding Southbay. You must defeat the orcs. The ships aren’t ready yet. We must defeat this army of orcs to buy us more time. Try not to kill us all with that ruby!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Prince Haldric",
            text: _("Very well. I’ll do my best."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_17",
        on: "turn",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "turn_number",
            equals: 5,
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "Lord_Typhon",
            type: "Merman Warrior",
            side: 1,
            x: 2,
            y: 19,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Lord_Typhon",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:make_loyal",
            unit: "Lord_Typhon",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_1",
            type: "Merman Fighter",
            side: 1,
            x: 1,
            y: 19,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "u_1",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:make_loyal",
            unit: "u_1",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_2",
            type: "Merman Hunter",
            side: 1,
            x: 3,
            y: 18,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "u_2",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:make_loyal",
            unit: "u_2",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Lord Typhon",
            text: _("I come seeking the Crown Prince!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "King Addroran IX",
            text: _("Who is this fish man?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Lady Jessene",
            text: _("He’s a large part of the reason your son made it to the lands of the east. Lord Typhon provided us with pearls and an escort for our voyages in exchange for steel trident points and fishhooks. It’s difficult to be a blacksmith when you live underwater."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Lord Typhon",
            text: _("Indeed it is. But where is the Prince?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Lady Jessene",
            text: _("The Crown Prince is dead. But we have need of your services again—"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Lord Typhon",
            text: _("Under the same terms?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Lady Jessene",
            text: _("Agreed."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Lord Typhon",
            text: _("Good. We need the steel for our own war in the deep. I formally place the might of the merfolk at your disposal!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("You can now recruit merfolk!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:config_recruit",
            side: 1,
            mode: "allow",
            types: "Merman Fighter,Merman Hunter",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:show_objectives",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_18",
        on: "turn",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "turn_number",
            equals: 30,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "King Addroran IX",
            text: _("Make haste. We must secure the frontier or it’s all over!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_19",
        on: "turn",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "turn_number",
            equals: 4,
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "Familiar",
            type: "Familiar",
            side: 6,
            x: 41,
            y: 22,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Familiar",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:make_loyal",
            unit: "Familiar",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "Lich-Lord_Jevyan",
            type: "Jevyan Cloaked",
            side: 6,
            x: 41,
            y: 23,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Lich-Lord_Jevyan",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:make_loyal",
            unit: "Lich-Lord_Jevyan",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Lich-Lord Jevyan",
            text: _("King Addroran, your day is done. Prepare to be ground to dust. If you’re lucky I may raise you from death for my own amusement. Oh, and what’s this? I sense, I sense the Ruby of Fire."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Lady Jessene",
            text: _("You monster! You’ve betrayed our people — to ally yourself with these orcs?!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "Fool_Prince",
            type: "Death Knight",
            side: 6,
            x: 42,
            y: 23,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Fool_Prince",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:make_loyal",
            unit: "Fool_Prince",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Lich-Lord Jevyan",
            text: _("Fool girl! My ambition is boundless; I will survive to rule the orcs and all else. That is more than can be said for you. King Addroran, meet your son — you’ll be joining him soon enough."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "King Addroran IX",
            text: _("NO!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Fool Prince",
            text: _("Fath-er! Join... us..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Lady Jessene",
            text: _("His older brother was more attractive..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:kill_unit",
            unit: "Lich-Lord Jevyan",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_3",
            type: "Revenant",
            side: 6,
            x: 40,
            y: 21,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "u_3",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:make_loyal",
            unit: "u_3",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_4",
            type: "Bone Shooter",
            side: 6,
            x: 42,
            y: 23,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "u_4",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
