            x: 15,
            y: 29,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("They sealed it, there is no escape for you!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_28",
        on: "last_breath",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22King%20Addroran%20IX%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("I am finished."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Prince Haldric",
            portrait: "portraits/haldric-surprised.webp",
            text: _("We needed him to hold Southbay. We’re done for!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "lose",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_29",
        on: "enemies_defeated",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Prince Haldric",
            text: _("We’ve defeated the orcs. Let’s rig the ships and get out of here."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "King Addroran IX",
            text: _("Oh, for my sons... — As we agreed. I will hold Southbay until my last breath."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Lady Jessene",
            text: _("With the help of the merfolk, and my knowledge of an island that will make a good re-provisioning point, we should be able to embark for the great lands that are to the east."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Lady Jessene",
            text: _("What I don’t like is the fact that Lich-Lord Jevyan, after whom our very capital is named, betrayed my people. To make matters worse, he knows that you have that ruby."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Prince Haldric",
            text: _("There’s not much we can do about that now. I dub this fine ship the Eldaric, in honor of my father. About that island..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Burin the Lost",
            text: _("Great, more boats, and now an ocean!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "King Addroran IX",
            text: _("After you make it to this new land, send some of the ships back, for there may still be survivors in Southbay."),
          },
          {
            tag: "win",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_30",
        on: "die",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
